{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a medieval store where everyday groceries sit alongside swords and shields. Manage your inventory, set prices, fund adventurers, and turn a small shop into a bustling business. You bankroll adventurers so they are well equipped for their journeys and benefit from the loot they bring back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapon Restoration</strong> <br>Clean, restore, and upgrade battered medieval weapons. Turn rusted, bloodied steel back into blades fit for battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/3bd7dd1432fbbe97468a179626b1f478.poster.avif?t=1768895295\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/3bd7dd1432fbbe97468a179626b1f478.webm?t=1768895295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/3bd7dd1432fbbe97468a179626b1f478.mp4?t=1768895295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventurer Funding</strong> <br>Send adventurers out with a simple investment. They\u2019ll return with loot-filled chests containing rare weapons, gear, and valuable items you can resell for profit. Their success fuels your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/c54fe7d157964739124b26b49c2621cb.poster.avif?t=1768895295\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/c54fe7d157964739124b26b49c2621cb.webm?t=1768895295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/c54fe7d157964739124b26b49c2621cb.mp4?t=1768895295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Store Management</strong><br>Buy and sell a wide range of items, from apples and bread to axes and armor. Keep your shelves stocked, adjust prices based on demand, and serve customers efficiently to keep the gold flowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/ec908f2df1fbab60c7a7c036dc6da2f1.poster.avif?t=1768895295\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/ec908f2df1fbab60c7a7c036dc6da2f1.webm?t=1768895295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/ec908f2df1fbab60c7a7c036dc6da2f1.mp4?t=1768895295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory and Pricing</strong><br>Track your stock carefully. Too much of one item can leave customers unsatisfied, while rare goods can bring in huge profits. Smart pricing and good product selection are key to growing your wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/d969f6bc47f3e9bc091e77cd579a580f.poster.avif?t=1768895295\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/d969f6bc47f3e9bc091e77cd579a580f.webm?t=1768895295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/d969f6bc47f3e9bc091e77cd579a580f.mp4?t=1768895295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Growth</strong><br>The heart of the game lies in smart decision-making. Choose where to invest, which products to focus on, and how to grow your store into the most trusted and profitable shop in the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/2e1addfbb3b2afea1452a33baff9b97c.poster.avif?t=1768895295\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/2e1addfbb3b2afea1452a33baff9b97c.webm?t=1768895295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927780/extras/2e1addfbb3b2afea1452a33baff9b97c.mp4?t=1768895295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Customers I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927780/43a0df609633bab4a64c179673fa3dc3de571cb4.jpg"},{"name":"Customers II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927780/090f3495ab467863ac2ebd276e59c4808b17e24e.jpg"},{"name":"Customers III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927780/9d3f800e92f1b012995b1d82831175aea7939eb6.jpg"},{"name":"Customers IV","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927780/e7c666b01c9360612fcec5f4df0e3bf99921d3f6.jpg"},{"name":"Customers V","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927780/c3d8f6d0cda09261a3f6a609bfa7af9580bd9116.jpg"},{"name":"Orders I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927780/1dbb99b41c8655ef086ff3b776d1c41d17979bfe.jpg"},{"name":"Orders II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3927780/f8d0f22a8001ede2312c1d5b8d3d967e414263dd.jpg"},{"name":"Orders III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.ste